### Health Check
# Checks Redis, Postgres, and Qdrant connectivity
GET http://localhost:8000/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Query Generation
# Expands a query into multiple semantically varied search queries
POST http://localhost:8000/query/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "how does transformer attention work",
  "num_queries": 5,
  "include_original": true
}

###

### Search
# Searches SearXNG and returns structured results (cached after first call)
POST http://localhost:8000/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "transformer attention mechanism",
  "num_results": 10,
  "engines": [],
  "safe_search": 1,
  "use_cache": true
}

###

### Search with specific engines
POST http://localhost:8000/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "python asyncio best practices",
  "num_results": 5,
  "engines": ["google", "duckduckgo"],
  "use_cache": false
}

###

### Crawl URLs (HTTP only)
POST http://localhost:8000/crawl
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "urls": [
    "https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.03762",
    "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Attention_(machine_learning)"
  ],
  "use_playwright": false,
  "respect_robots": true,
  "use_cache": true
}

###

### Crawl with Playwright (for JS-heavy pages)
POST http://localhost:8000/crawl
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "urls": ["https://github.com/huggingface/transformers"],
  "use_playwright": true,
  "respect_robots": true,
  "use_cache": true
}

###

### Extract content from URL
POST http://localhost:8000/extract
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.03762",
  "output_format": "markdown",
  "with_metadata": true
}

###

### Extract content from raw HTML
POST http://localhost:8000/extract
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "html": "<html><body><article><h1>Test</h1><p>Some content here to extract.</p></article></body></html>",
  "output_format": "markdown"
}

###

### Ingest URLs into vector store
# Full pipeline: crawl → extract → chunk → embed → store in Qdrant
POST http://localhost:8000/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "urls": [
    "https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.03762",
    "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Transformer_(deep_learning_architecture)"
  ],
  "collection": "research_papers",
  "chunk_size": 512,
  "chunk_overlap": 64,
  "use_playwright": false,
  "metadata": {
    "source": "arxiv",
    "topic": "transformers"
  }
}

###

### Retrieve: semantic search + rerank
POST http://localhost:8000/retrieve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "how does multi-head attention work",
  "collection": "research_papers",
  "top_k": 20,
  "rerank_top_k": 5,
  "score_threshold": 0.0
}

###

### Retrieve with metadata filter
POST http://localhost:8000/retrieve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "self-attention mechanism explained",
  "top_k": 10,
  "rerank_top_k": 3,
  "filters": {
    "topic": "transformers"
  }
}
